      "message": "No, Keccak[c] is the underlying sponge with a capacity of c. The SHA-3 functions then use a sponge with capacity 2 * size.\n\nFrom FIPS 202, Section 6.1: SHA3-256(M) \u003d KECCAK[512] (M || 01, 256)",
